  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help Mountainside School Fight Illiteracy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Saul Louis Community School (academic/vocational) will provide 315-350 students and 10 teachers with standard school supplies, proper facilities equipment, and a safe, physical environment, which will fuel quality learning, teaching and success. It will also equip the community&apos;s vocational students, currently studying music, and teachers with the instruments needed to produce highly skilled and trained professionals, who can earn a living providing services in their mountainside community.</narrative>
  </description>
